WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Step the feet wide apart, outer edges roughly parallel.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rest the hands on the hips and lift the chest.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Inhale, lengthen the spine, then exhale and hinge forward from the hips.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Bring the hands to the floor or blocks under the shoulders.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Let the crown release toward the floor; hold, then rise with a long back.
